  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 3110.02 Course Size",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-05-25",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3110.02 Course Size. No driver education program shall have more than 30 students, or more than the maximum number of students approved for the location, attending each course.\n\nSource. #7362, eff 12-1-00; ss by #9331, INTERIM, eff 11-26-08, EXPIRED: 5-25-09\n\nNew. #9568, eff 10-17-09 (from Saf-C 3113.02); ss by #12509, eff 4-5-18 (formerly Saf-C 3114.02) (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Saf-C 3100)",
